Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.00,0:00:30.80,H_en,,0,0,0,,Why do you care if she lives or dies, CEO Shen?
Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.00,0:00:30.80,C_en,,0,0,0,,Watch ALL episodes FREE ▶ YT688.app
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.04,0:00:00.94,S_en,,0,0,0,,She's just Jian Tong.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.98,0:00:01.88,S_en,,0,0,0,,Shen Xiujin.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.92,0:00:02.82,S_en,,0,0,0,,Don't even try to deny it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.22,0:00:04.12,S_en,,0,0,0,,If she's not your girlfriend,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.16,0:00:05.06,S_en,,0,0,0,,why do you care if she lives or dies?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.10,0:00:06.46,S_en,,0,0,0,,Her fever is none of your business.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.62,0:00:07.78,S_en,,0,0,0,,Don't say you pity her.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.62,0:00:09.70,S_en,,0,0,0,,Mr. CEO Shen,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.74,0:00:11.30,S_en,,0,0,0,,since when are you this compassionate?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.50,0:00:12.66,S_en,,0,0,0,,If she weren't your sweetheart,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.78,0:00:13.94,S_en,,0,0,0,,would you drive her yourself at midnight
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.98,0:00:14.88,S_en,,0,0,0,,to the hospital?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.74,0:00:16.70,S_en,,0,0,0,,Yeah right.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.66,0:00:19.56,S_en,,0,0,0,,Mr. Shen,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.02,0:00:20.92,S_en,,0,0,0,,If that's all,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.96,0:00:21.86,S_en,,0,0,0,,I'll head out.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.98,0:00:22.88,S_en,,0,0,0,,She stays here.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.62,0:00:24.74,S_en,,0,0,0,,Watch her carefully.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.84,0:00:26.74,S_en,,0,0,0,,If she wakes up,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.80,0:00:27.76,S_en,,0,0,0,,tell her
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.12,0:00:29.08,S_en,,0,0,0,,that when she passed out,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.44,0:00:30.80,S_en,,0,0,0,,you had a friend come treat her.
